Find goldens (TestFindGolden, TestFindAgree, TestUnverifiedInventory).

One section per case:

  -- <name> --
  in <string>                 the content; or, instead of in:
  shape <shape name> <n>      the named shapes_test.go generator at n bytes
  out <link>                  zero or more: Find's links, in order
  // unverified: <ID> <note>  the expectation rests on an unverified point
  // verified <date> <case>: <note>
                              a point the private-channel harness settled
  // uncapped: <link>         cap rows: the uncapped grammar's answer, one
                              line per link ("// uncapped: none" for no
                              link), when it differs from Find's capped one

<string> is a Go-quoted string, or several joined by " + ", each optionally
repeated with *N: "https://a.com/" + "x"*1980. <link> is

  <Kind> <string URL> [spoiler] [label=<string>]

with Kind one of Bare, Suppressed, Masked, MaskedSuppressed; label= appears
iff the label is not empty, and only for the Masked kinds. A case with no out
line expects no links. Blank lines and lines starting with "# " are ignored.

Expectations were computed with tools/discordref (simple-markdown with
Discord's overrides and Find's documented choices, with and without the
nesting limit) and agree with findRef; the shape rows use the shapes at
4 KB. Never edit an expectation to match code: a disagreement is a bug on
one side or a question for the maintainer.

Unverified IDs: U1 (is ')' balanced?), U2 (do masked links embed?), U3
(upper-case scheme), U4 (server unfurl vs client link), L1 (label filter), L2
([l](<url) kind), L3 (a non-http target is consumed), A1 (whitespace in an
autolink target), B1 (block rules).

-- bare-trailing-dot --
in "see https://a.com/x."
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- bare-in-parens --
in "(https://a.com/x)"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"
// unverified: U1 the unbalanced trailing ) is trimmed

-- bare-balanced-parens --
in "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foo_(bar)"
out Bare "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foo_(bar)"
// unverified: U1 a balanced ) stays in the URL

-- bare-unbalanced-paren --
in "https://a.com/x)"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"
// unverified: U1 the unbalanced trailing ) is trimmed

-- bare-nested-parens --
in "(see https://a.com/wiki/Foo_(bar))"
out Bare "https://a.com/wiki/Foo_(bar)"
// unverified: U1 only the unbalanced ) is trimmed

-- bare-trailing-quote --
in "https://a.com/x'"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- bare-in-double-quotes --
in "\"https://a.com/x\""
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- bare-trailing-bracket --
in "https://a.com/x]"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- bare-stops-at-angle --
in "https://a.com/a<b"
out Bare "https://a.com/a"

-- bare-paren-run --
in "x https://a.com/a_(b)_c)"
out Bare "https://a.com/a_(b)_c"
// unverified: U1 the unbalanced trailing ) is trimmed

-- bare-semicolon-paren --
in "https://a.com/x;)"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"
// unverified: U1 trimming ) re-applies the last-character rule

-- bare-excluded-tail --
in "http://a.com/.,:;"
out Bare "http://a.com/"

-- bare-trailing-angle --
in "https://a.com/x>"
out Bare "https://a.com/x>"

-- bare-trailing-pipes --
in "https://a.com/x||"
out Bare "https://a.com/x||"

-- bare-backticks-inside --
in "https://a.com/`x`"
out Bare "https://a.com/`x`"

-- bare-emphasis-inside --
in "https://a.com/x**y**"
out Bare "https://a.com/x**y**"

-- bare-escaped-underscore-inside --
in "https://a.com/\\_x_"
out Bare "https://a.com/\\_x_"

-- bare-nbsp-ends --
in "https://a.com/x\u00a0tail"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- bare-ideographic-space-ends --
in "https://a.com/x\u3000tail"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- bare-zwsp-inside --
in "https://a.com/x\u200btail"
out Bare "https://a.com/x\u200btail"

-- bare-nel-inside --
in "https://a.com/x\u0085tail"
out Bare "https://a.com/x\u0085tail"

-- bare-bom-ends --
in "https://a.com/x\ufefftail"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- bare-scheme-only --
in "https://"

-- bare-one-char --
in "https://a"

-- bare-after-word --
in "foohttps://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- bare-upper-scheme --
in "HTTPS://a.com/x"
// unverified: U3 upper-case schemes are not links

-- bare-mixed-case-scheme --
in "Https://a.com/x"
// unverified: U3 upper-case schemes are not links

-- bare-steam-scheme --
in "steam://run/1 https://a.com"
out Bare "https://a.com"

-- bare-after-backslash --
in "\\https://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- bare-escape-inside-scheme --
in "h\\ttps://a.com/x"

-- bare-after-unclosed-angle --
in "<https://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- bare-after-escaped-angle --
in "\\<https://a.com/x>"
out Bare "https://a.com/x>"

-- bare-after-escaped-bracket --
in "\\[lbl](https://a.com/x)"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- bare-after-code-block --
in "https://a.com/x\n```\ncode\n```"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- autolink --
in "<https://a.com/x>"
out Suppressed "https://a.com/x"

-- autolink-space --
in "<https://a.com/x y>"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- autolink-newline --
in "<https://a.com/x\ny>"
out Suppressed "https://a.com/x\ny"
// unverified: A1 a newline inside the target is kept

-- autolink-tab --
in "<https://a.com/x\ty>"
out Suppressed "https://a.com/x\ty"
# simple-markdown's parse turns the tab into four spaces first, so its
# answer is Bare "https://a.com/x"; Find parses the content as sent.
// unverified: A1 a tab inside the target is kept

-- autolink-nbsp --
in "<https://a.com/x\u00a0y>"
out Suppressed "https://a.com/x\u00a0y"
// unverified: A1 an NBSP inside the target is kept

-- autolink-one-slash --
in "<https:/a.com>"

-- autolink-ftp --
in "<ftp://a.com/x>"

-- autolink-mailto --
in "<mailto:a@b.c>"

-- autolink-upper-scheme --
in "<HTTPS://a.com/x> https://b.com/y"
out Bare "https://b.com/y"
// unverified: U3 an upper-case autolink is consumed and not reported

-- autolink-doubled --
in "<<https://a.com/x>>"

-- autolink-trailing-angle --
in "<https://a.com/x>>"
out Suppressed "https://a.com/x"

-- autolink-in-spoiler --
in "||<https://a.com/x>||"
out Suppressed "https://a.com/x" spoiler

-- masked --
in "[lbl](https://a.com/x)"
out Masked "https://a.com/x" label="lbl"
// unverified: U2 Masked: WouldEmbed reports a preview

-- masked-suppressed --
in "[lbl](<https://a.com/x>)"
out MaskedSuppressed "https://a.com/x" label="lbl"

-- masked-parens-in-target --
in "[lbl](https://a.com/(b))"
out Masked "https://a.com/(b)" label="lbl"

-- masked-title --
in "[lbl](https://a.com/x \"title\")"
out Masked "https://a.com/x" label="lbl"

-- masked-nested-brackets --
in "[l[i]b](https://a.com/x)"
out Masked "https://a.com/x" label="l[i]b"

-- masked-javascript --
in "[lbl](javascript:alert(1)) https://b.com"
out Bare "https://b.com"
// unverified: L3 a non-http target is consumed and not reported

-- masked-ftp-target --
in "[l](ftp://a.com/x) https://b.com/y"
out Bare "https://b.com/y"
// unverified: L3 a non-http target is consumed and not reported

-- masked-link-label --
in "[https://a.com/x](https://b.com/y)"
out Bare "https://a.com/x](https://b.com/y)"
// unverified: L1 a label with http(s):// fails the masked rule

-- masked-link-label-text --
in "[see https://a.com/x here](https://b.com/y) z"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://b.com/y"
// unverified: L1 a label with http(s):// fails the masked rule

-- masked-angle-trailing --
in "[lbl](https://a.com/x)>"
out Masked "https://a.com/x" label="lbl"

-- masked-parens-after --
in "[l](https://a.com/x)(b)"
out Masked "https://a.com/x" label="l"

-- masked-spaces --
in "[l]( https://a.com/x )"
out Masked "https://a.com/x" label="l"

-- masked-space-in-target --
in "[l](https://a.com/x y)"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- masked-newline-before-paren --
in "[l]\n(https://a.com/x)"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- masked-newline-in-label --
in "[l\nm](https://a.com/x)"
out Masked "https://a.com/x" label="l\nm"

-- masked-empty-label --
in "[](https://a.com/x)"
out Masked "https://a.com/x"

-- masked-escaped-paren --
in "[l](https://a.com/x\\)y)"
out Masked "https://a.com/x\\)y" label="l"

-- masked-greedy-label --
in "[a](b](https://a.com/x)"
out Masked "https://a.com/x" label="a](b"

-- masked-href-backtracking --
in "[l](a(b \"t\") https://c.com/d"
out Bare "https://c.com/d"

-- masked-empty-target-title --
in "[l]( \"https://a.com b\")"

-- masked-open-angle-only --
in "[l](<https://a.com/x) z"
out Masked "https://a.com/x" label="l"
// unverified: L2 Masked, not MaskedSuppressed: the > was not consumed (simple-markdown says MaskedSuppressed)

-- masked-in-spoiler-strong --
in "||**[l](<https://a.com/x>)**||"
out MaskedSuppressed "https://a.com/x" spoiler label="l"

-- spoiler --
in "||https://a.com/x||"
out Bare "https://a.com/x" spoiler
// unverified: U4 a spoilered link is counted as previewed

-- spoiler-first-closer --
in "||https://a.com/x||y||"
out Bare "https://a.com/x" spoiler

-- spoiler-pairs-around --
in "||a|| https://a.com/x ||b||"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- spoiler-unclosed --
in "|| unclosed https://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- spoiler-four-pipes --
in "||||https://a.com/x||"
out Bare "https://a.com/x" spoiler

-- spoiler-ignores-escapes --
in "||a\\||https://a.com/x||"
out Bare "https://a.com/x||"

-- strong --
in "**https://a.com/x**"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- strong-extra-star --
in "**https://a.com/x***"
out Bare "https://a.com/x*"

-- strong-escaped-closer --
in "**a\\** https://b.com/y**"
out Bare "https://b.com/y"

-- strong-ignores-code --
in "**a`**`https://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- em-star --
in "*https://a.com/a*b*"
out Bare "https://a.com/a"

-- em-star-space-after-opener --
in "* https://a.com/x*"
out Bare "https://a.com/x*"

-- em-star-space-before-closer --
in "*https://a.com/x *"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- em-star-escaped-space --
in "*https://a.com/x\\ *"
out Bare "https://a.com/x\\"

-- em-wins-by-quality --
in "***https://a.com/x*"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- em-odd-run-closes --
in "*a ***https://a.com/x*"
out Bare "https://a.com/x*"

-- em-underscore --
in "_https://a.com/x_"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- em-underscore-after-word --
in "a_https://a.com/x_"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- em-underscore-inner --
in "_https://a.com/a_b_"
out Bare "https://a.com/a_b_"

-- em-underscore-space --
in "_a https://a.com/x_"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- u --
in "__https://a.com/a__b__"
out Bare "https://a.com/a"

-- u-extra-underscore --
in "__https://a.com/x___"
out Bare "https://a.com/x_"

-- del --
in "~~https://a.com/x~~"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- del-extra-tilde --
in "~~https://a.com/x~~~"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- del-not-before-underscore --
in "~~https://a.com/x~~_"
out Bare "https://a.com/x~~_"

-- code --
in "`https://a.com/x`"
// unverified: U4 a link in a code span is not a link

-- code-double-backtick --
in "``a`https://a.com/x``"

-- code-opener-backtracks --
in "``a`https://a.com/x` https://b.com/z"
out Bare "https://a.com/x`"
out Bare "https://b.com/z"

-- code-spaces --
in "`` https://a.com/x ``"

-- code-crosses-lines --
in "`a\nhttps://a.com/x`"

-- code-unclosed --
in "`unclosed https://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- fence --
in "```\nhttps://a.com/x\n```"

-- fence-one-line --
in "```https://a.com/x```"

-- fence-language --
in "```go\nfmt.Println(\"https://a.com/x\")\n``` https://b.com/y"
out Bare "https://b.com/y"

-- fence-unclosed --
in "``` https://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- mentions --
in "<@123> https://a.com/x <#456> <:e:789> <t:1:R>"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- mention-emoji-underscore --
in "<:a_:1> https://a.com/x_"
out Bare "https://a.com/x_"

-- mention-user-nick --
in "<@!1> https://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- mention-role --
in "<@&1> https://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- mention-channel --
in "<#1> https://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- mention-game --
in "<@$1> https://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- mention-slash --
in "</a_b c:1> https://a.com/x_"
out Bare "https://a.com/x_"

-- mention-animated-emoji --
in "<a:b_c:1> https://a.com/x_"
out Bare "https://a.com/x_"

-- mention-timestamp --
in "<t:1> https://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- mention-timestamp-not --
in "<t:1_> https://a.com/x_"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- mention-timestamp-style --
in "<t:-1:F> https://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- mention-guild-nav --
in "<1:linked-roles:2> https://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- mention-guild-nav-browse --
in "<1:browse> https://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- subtext --
in "-# https://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- quote --
in "> https://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"

-- subtext-spoiler-across-lines --
in "-# ||a\n||https://a.com/x||"
out Bare "https://a.com/x||"
// unverified: B1 the spoiler crosses into a subtext line; Discord may scope it per line

-- heading-strong-across-lines --
in "# **a\nhttps://a.com/x**"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"
// unverified: B1 the strong span crosses out of a heading line; Discord may scope it per line

-- quote-code-across-lines --
in "> `a\nhttps://a.com/x` https://b.com/y"
out Bare "https://b.com/y"
// unverified: B1 the code span crosses out of a quote line; Discord may scope it per line

-- invalid-utf8-inside --
in "https://a.com/\xff\xfe x"
out Bare "https://a.com/\xff\xfe"
# Not in the oracle: JavaScript strings cannot hold invalid UTF-8.

-- invalid-utf8-after-escape --
in "\\\xff https://a.com/x"
out Bare "https://a.com/x"
# Not in the oracle: JavaScript strings cannot hold invalid UTF-8.

-- cap-star-wrap-34 --
in "*"*34 + "https://a.com/x" + "*"*34
out Bare "https://a.com/x**********************************"
# The '*' runs nest past the limit among themselves, but the link sits
# at most two levels deep, so the limit does not change the answer.

-- cap-star-wrap-36 --
in "*"*36 + "https://a.com/x" + "*"*36
out Bare "https://a.com/x************************************"
# The '*' runs nest past the limit among themselves, but the link sits
# at most two levels deep, so the limit does not change the answer.

-- cap-star-wrap-40 --
in "*"*40 + "https://a.com/x" + "*"*40
out Bare "https://a.com/x****************************************"
# The '*' runs nest past the limit among themselves, but the link sits
# at most two levels deep, so the limit does not change the answer.

-- cap-star-wrap-spoiler-34 --
in "*"*34 + "||https://a.com/x||" + "*"*34
out Bare "https://a.com/x" spoiler
# The '*' runs nest past the limit among themselves, but the link sits
# at most two levels deep, so the limit does not change the answer.

-- cap-star-wrap-spoiler-35 --
in "*"*35 + "||https://a.com/x||" + "*"*35
out Bare "https://a.com/x" spoiler
# The '*' runs nest past the limit among themselves, but the link sits
# at most two levels deep, so the limit does not change the answer.

-- cap-star-wrap-spoiler-36 --
in "*"*36 + "||https://a.com/x||" + "*"*36
out Bare "https://a.com/x" spoiler
# The '*' runs nest past the limit among themselves, but the link sits
# at most two levels deep, so the limit does not change the answer.

-- shape-backslash-run --
shape backslash-run 4096
out Bare "https://a.example/x"

-- shape-backtick-runs --
shape backtick-runs 4096
out Bare "https://a.example/x"

-- shape-bracket-gap --
shape bracket-gap 4096
out Bare "https://a.example/x"

-- shape-href-paren-quote --
shape href-paren-quote 4096
out Bare "https://a.example/x"

-- shape-label-chain --
shape label-chain 4096
out Bare "https://a.example/x"

-- shape-masked-candidates --
shape masked-candidates 4096
out Bare "https://a.example/x"

-- shape-masked-close-chain --
shape masked-close-chain 4096
out Bare "https://a.example/x"

-- shape-masked-every-level --
shape masked-every-level 4096
out Bare "https://a.example/x" spoiler

-- shape-masked-unclosed --
shape masked-unclosed 4096
out Bare "https://a.example/x"

-- shape-mention-colon --
shape mention-colon 4096
out Bare "https://a.example/x"

-- shape-mixed-delims --
shape mixed-delims 4096
out Bare "https://a.example/x"

-- shape-nested-open --
shape nested-open 4096
out Bare "https://a.example/x" spoiler

-- shape-open-angle --
shape open-angle 4096
out Bare "https://a.example/x"

-- shape-open-backtick --
shape open-backtick 4096
out Bare "https://a.example/x"

-- shape-open-bracket --
shape open-bracket 4096
out Bare "https://a.example/x"

-- shape-paren-run --
shape paren-run 4096
out Bare "https://a.com/"

-- shape-paren-units --
shape paren-units 4096
out Bare "https://a.com/x"
